{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeTT5jGfUgEswK5YrNg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Decision: DR-9003\n\n## Analysis\n\n**Steps 1–3: Request identification**\n- Request ID: DR-9003\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730)\n- Product: NS-CLOUD (NS-Cloud Operations Suite, SKU NS-CLOUD, list $120,000)\n- Requested discount: 15%\n- Date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example, Enterprise Account Executive)\n- Basis claimed: Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\n\n**Step 4: Active contract**\n- ACME-MFG-2025 is active on 2026-09-23 (term: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\n- The contract covers NS-CLOUD, among other products\n\n**Step 5: Pricing exception for this product**\nThis is the critical issue.\n\nThe request relies on \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement.\" The contract contains Section 3.2:\n\n> \"Customer is eligible for discounts of up to **15%** on the NS-500 Industrial Controller, as set out in the pricing exception attached as Schedule B.\"\n\nThat pricing exception is **EXC-ACME-NS500-15**, which states:\n\n> \"This exception applies only to the product identified above. It does not apply to any other Northstar product. Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller (NS-500) only.\"\n\n**The 15% discount applies to NS-500, not NS-CLOUD.** There is no pricing exception for NS-CLOUD. The contract establishes that Acme Manufacturing can purchase NS-CLOUD, but it does not establish a specific discount percentage for that product.\n\n**Step 6–8: Policy and authority**\n- Policy in effect on 2026-09-23: PRICING-POLICY-2026\n- Sarah Chen's role: Enterprise Account Executive\n- Sarah Chen's authority: up to 10% (per PRICING-POLICY-2026)\n- Requested discount: 15% (exceeds her authority)\n- Required approver for >10% and ≤20%: VP Sales (Michael Torres, EMP-200)\n\nEven if commercial eligibility were established, Sarah Chen could not approve this.\n\n**Step 9: Outcome**\n\nThe request relies on special contract terms (the Master Supply Agreement), but those terms do not cover this product. The contract specifies 15% pricing only for NS-500. No pricing exception exists for NS-CLOUD. Under the procedure's principle: *\"A pricing exception is scoped to the product and dates it names.\"* This requires commercial review before it can proceed.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9003\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048 / C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-CLOUD (NS-Cloud Operations Suite)\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"not_covered\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"ACME-MFG-2025 grant 15% pricing for NS-500 only via EXC-ACME-NS500-15. EXC-ACME-NS500-15 expressly limits application to NS-500. No pricing exception covers NS-CLOUD.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (EMP-200)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 (active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (NS-500 only, max 15%)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (effective 2026-09-23)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Pricing exception or contract amendment establishing NS-CLOUD eligibility and discount terms\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Commercial review: The request cites ACME-MFG-2025, but that agreement specifies the 15% discount only for NS-500 (via EXC-ACME-NS500-15). NS-CLOUD is not within scope. Establish whether NS-CLOUD should be eligible for 15%, and if so, create or amend the applicable pricing exception.\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk or Revenue Operations\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5923,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5923},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d9d6d4d-693f-4f88-b8d3-f61cc4ade2ff","uuid":"0aa415e1-a296-488e-8e3e-544cad202f9e","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:55:15.912Z","request_id":"req_011CfpeTSqMeAUeW3B8ruu3c"}
